# Reports

Generated analysis outputs including HTML, PDF, LaTeX documents, and other report formats.

## Contents

- Analysis reports
- Presentations
- Generated documentation
- Executive summaries

> [!NOTE]
> Report files are gitignored by default. Commit final reports to a releases branch or store in a documentation system.

## Generating Reports

```bash
# Example: Generate HTML report from notebook
jupyter nbconvert --to html notebooks/01-analysis.ipynb --output ../reports/analysis-report.html

# Example: Generate PDF report
jupyter nbconvert --to pdf notebooks/01-analysis.ipynb --output ../reports/analysis-report.pdf
```
